<title>USA: Group holds 10.28 pct Cinar Films stake.</title>
<headline>Group holds 10.28 pct Cinar Films stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Mellon Bank Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Tuesday it holds a 10.28 percent stake in Cinar Films Inc or 923,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Cinar in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
